message: "If you use racetraQ in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "racetraQ: a quantum reinforcement learning racing demo"
abstract: >-
  A race car driven by a variational quantum circuit trained with double deep
  Q-learning, next to a matched classical baseline, with multi-seed studies,
  a light-cone analysis and a hardware path to IBM Quantum devices.
